- ### ---Persia Region--- ###

    - # ---Tocharia/SHL/KUC, etc. ---#
      - Massive mission tree remake/expansion, unique economic, military, political, and expansion paths for all
        - Unified start of all branches (economic, conquest, military) into three base paths with unlockable unique missions based off branch selected to preserve unity of tree and gameplay
