        - * Structure of conquest across Branches goes 
          - * [1.] Conquer Region and Continue 
              - [1A.] invest in development (political/culture/economic of region) 
          - * [2.] Lite post-regional conquest mission to grant claims on regions that such an empire would claim or lay claim to in their 
